        <mxCell id="legend" value="Crow's foot = many · tick = one · label = via &lt;column&gt; [ON DELETE rule].&#10;Solid: a foreign key in the database. Dashed grey: an id kept WITHOUT a foreign key, on purpose — notifications, invitations, notices, history,&#10;reminders and kept files outlive what they point at. Flags: PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique · AI auto increment · NN not null · DEF default.&#10;Generated from the schema the API builds (sync + migrations), 2026-11-12. CONSULTANT_COURSES.course_id is SET NULL, never CASCADE." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#616161;" vertex="1" parent="1">
